  "notes": "Extra read of the same detector as metrics.json at the level D5's headline rule picks from the SCORING-period noise curve, so D2, D4, D6, D7 and I1 here are tuned on test (exploratory, for comparison with the reference at its own noise). Rank product of component A (the year-1 re-tuned live set: profile excess, phenotype excess, new-in-unit) and component B (the 0016 CUSUM union, Poisson weekly theta 8 plus Bernoulli theta 8 guard band 4 weeks, equalised mapping); quantile ranks against the real cell-days 2024-01-01 to 2024-09-30, frozen; harness p = RP^2 (1 - 2 ln RP). Operating level (loosest with year-1 noise at most 5 a year) p = 3e-05. Join: cell = unit x organism-or-phenotype, 7-day carry-forward, silent = 1, new-in-unit = 1e-6 (all proposed (overnight), pending Artem). Seed 2026, 200 trials per cell. Plan: experiments/0022-ensemble/README.md.",
